    "heading": "Powerful Creatures",
    "lineStart": 14416,
    "lineEnd": 14418
  },
  "section": "9.80",
  "rulesText": "If your combat encounter includes a creature whose CR is higher than the party's level, be aware that such a creature might deal enough damage with a single action to take out one or more characters. For example, an Ogre (CR 2) can kill a level 1 Wizard with a single blow."
}
